        "PMC10056590::web::019::3_3_slow_cooling_of_equiatomic_crmnfecon"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid quenching preserves a metastable BCC structure in Cr39Co18Fe18Ni18Al7.",
